      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-a79ed8d27cd380a461295a8f",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "不良事件（AE）指临床试验参与者在接受试验用药品之后出现的所有不良医学事件，可以表现为症状体征、疾病和/或有临床意义的实验室检查异常，但不一定与试验用药品有因果关系。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p986"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27520,
      "source_ref": "body.p986",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p986"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-25c54cb8c26bb63bc2ee981a",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "但下列情况不应作为AE记录：",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p987"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27530,
      "source_ref": "body.p987",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p987"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-817da941f30c4b93962ccdd0",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "筛选时发现的已存在的情况（例如筛选时实验室检查、心电图检查、生命体征、体格检查等结果显示具有临床意义的异常，但经由研究者判断该异常在参与者知情同意前已存在）；该种情况应作为病史/伴随疾病进行记录。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p988"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27540,
      "source_ref": "body.p988",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p988"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-37c9d17909babcfeb6751355",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "计划的住院/手术；除非计划住院/手术的情况较原有情况加重。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p989"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27550,
      "source_ref": "body.p989",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p989"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-c66377676c62953521c632dd",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "内科和外科侵入性检查（如肝脏活检、内镜检查等）；但导致需实施这些检查的疾病可能为不良事件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p990"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27560,
      "source_ref": "body.p990",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p990"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-a225716c2306617235504444",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究的疾病预期进展和/或研究疾病的症状与体征出现预期进展；除非严重程度或发生频率高于预期。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "不良事件（AE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p991"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27570,
      "source_ref": "body.p991",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p991"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-43d93af855d2fae5096669d4",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "筛选时已存在的伴随疾病或原有症状、体征等出现预期的周期性波动，但并未恶化。",
      "heading_path": [
