      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p993"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27590,
      "source_ref": "body.p993",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p993"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-d8626e03738b112c04ee4913",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）是指在给药后出现的任何不利的医学事件。ICH E9 指南“临床试验统计原则”将“治疗期不良事件”定义为：“在治疗过程中出现的事件，在治疗前并未出现或相对于治疗前发生恶化”。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "治疗期出现的不良事件（TEAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p994"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27600,
      "source_ref": "body.p994",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p994"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-a81269fb1e97dc5bf5083168",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "严重不良事件（SAE）",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "严重不良事件（SAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p995"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 27610,
      "source_ref": "body.p995",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p995"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-684d5b1213112070366962ed",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "严重不良事件，指参与者接受试验用药品后出现死亡、危及生命、永久或者严重的残疾或者功能丧失、参与者需要住院治疗或者延长住院时间，以及先天性异常或者出生缺陷等不良医学事件。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
