    },
    {
      "excerpt": "严重不良事件（Serious Adverse Event，SAE）是指符合下列标准任何一项的不良事件：",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究评估和程序",
        "安全性评估",
        "术语定义",
        "严重不良事件（SAE）"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p997"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
